"The Seals are the source of all mana on Davrar; they make it, purify it and power the sun."
"A Seal's parts lock into orientations that set which type of mana it makes."
"A normal Seal makes neutral mana; a blighted Seal makes only its corrupt type."
"Seals separate mana and wizardry from a raw, unstable cosmic background, leaving both stable."
"Fusing mana and wizardry back together annihilates both in a sparkling light."
"A further depth beyond the aether is the true source of magic."
"The gaps in mana pools are filled with something Ushia believes is Davrar itself."
"Later, Stella gains nine mana types and a possible tenth that is not a true school."
"Later, Stella's mana is said to breed more of itself."
"Later, Stella kills a lightning-bodied Questor by threading magnetic mana into it."
"Years later, a few dozen metal-mana mages can raise a building in days."
"Years later, blending fire mana is shown to give blue-green flame."
